{"id":4120790,"shortDescription":"Un acogedor juego de clasificación en un tranquilo taller de Tokio. Los clientes traen cajas llenas de caos: botones, monedas, engranajes, sellos. Clasifica, agrupa y coloca todo en su sitio, entre clics ASMR satisfactorios. Sin cronómetros. Equivocarse no cuesta nada. Puro placer de ordenar.","developers":["Apelsinka Games"],"publishers":["Apelsinka Games"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Comodidad de la cámara","Controles de volumen personalizados","Dificultad ajustable","Opción solo ratón","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Guardar en cualquier momento","Sonido estéreo","Opción solo táctil","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"21 AGO 2026","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120790?t=1790334008","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120790/01c91081392bf1ed3bc5cf6edb03a1628cda8e37/ss_01c91081392bf1ed3bc5cf6edb03a1628cda8e37.600x338.jpg?t=1790334008","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120790/01c91081392bf1ed3bc5cf6edb03a1628cda8e37/ss_01c91081392bf1ed3bc5cf6edb03a1628cda8e37.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790334008"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120790/46668d3975afbae47cd56387bcd58edda84ce74b/ss_46668d3975afbae47cd56387bcd58edda84ce74b.600x338.jpg?t=1790334008","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120790/46668d3975afbae47cd56387bcd58edda84ce74b/ss_46668d3975afbae47cd56387bcd58edda84ce74b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790334008"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120790/33cc985279bcabda40b1ca4d1fc7a337b064e45b/ss_33cc985279bcabda40b1ca4d1fc7a337b064e45b.600x338.jpg?t=1790334008","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120790/33cc985279bcabda40b1ca4d1fc7a337b064e45b/ss_33cc985279bcabd